[{"text": "Hello, English learners. Welcome back to EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.8199999999999958, "end": 5.02}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 5.24, "end": 6.0}, {"text": "And today we're bringing you the sequel of I'm Sorry I Love You.", "start": 6.32, "end": 9.88}, {"text": "Part 2.", "start": 10.1, "end": 10.94}, {"text": "Part 2.", "start": 11.1, "end": 11.68}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 11.84, "end": 12.32}, {"text": "I guess a lot of our listeners enjoyed the first part.", "start": 12.5, "end": 15.44}, {"text": "And since it was such a romantic dialogue and hit, we're bringing part 2.", "start": 15.88, "end": 21.34}, {"text": "So it's even more romantic and I'm sure everyone is going to find some great and useful language in it.", "start": 21.48, "end": 28.0}, {"text": "That's right. We've got language that we use to talk about dates.", "start": 28.0, "end": 31.74}, {"text": "A date, yeah. So useful language for when you're going on a date.", "start": 31.94, "end": 35.6}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 35.88, "end": 36.46}, {"text": "Well, before we look at this date language, let's listen to the dialogue for the first time.", "start": 36.92, "end": 42.1}, {"text": "I'm so relieved that your ankle wasn't broken. I feel just awful about this whole thing.", "start": 47.84, "end": 52.2}, {"text": "I want to make it up to you. Let me take you out to dinner tonight, my treat.", "start": 52.46, "end": 55.7}, {"text": "Oh, that sounds great. I'd love to. Here's my address. Pick me up at 8.", "start": 55.7, "end": 61.2}, {"text": "Perfect.", "start": 61.74, "end": 62.18}, {"text": "Thank you for such a lovely evening. The food was amazing and I had a great time.", "start": 75.5, "end": 80.14}, {"text": "Me too. You look so beautiful tonight. I wish this night would never end.", "start": 80.14, "end": 85.18}, {"text": "There's something that I have to tell you.", "start": 85.82000000000001, "end": 87.18}, {"text": "But what is it?", "start": 87.52, "end": 88.44}, {"text": "I woke up today thinking that this would be just like any other day.", "start": 88.66, "end": 92.6}, {"text": "But I was wrong.", "start": 93.22, "end": 94.18}, {"text": "The twist of fate brought us together.", "start": 95.14, "end": 96.58}, {"text": "I crashed into your life and you into mine and...", "start": 96.86, "end": 99.34}, {"text": "This may sound crazy, but I'm falling in love with you, Veronica.", "start": 99.34, "end": 102.58}, {"text": "I'm falling in love with you, Veronica.", "start": 117.6, "end": 132.54}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 133.44, "end": 134.56}, {"text": "Today, we have three words for language takeaway.", "start": 135.52, "end": 138.18}, {"text": "And the first one is relieved.", "start": 138.52, "end": 141.1}, {"text": "Relieved.", "start": 141.82, "end": 142.38}, {"text": "Relieved.", "start": 142.86, "end": 143.42}, {"text": "So we have some great examples on how we use relieved.", "start": 143.96, "end": 146.7}, {"text": "And I'm really sure you can understand the meaning from the sentences.", "start": 146.72, "end": 149.58}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 150.78, "end": 151.7}, {"text": "They were relieved to hear that the company would not be making any layoffs.", "start": 153.7, "end": 156.96}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 161.12, "end": 161.98}, {"text": "I'm so relieved to hear your voice.", "start": 165.07999999999998, "end": 166.86}, {"text": "I was worried something happened to you.", "start": 167.08, "end": 168.84}, {"text": "I guess relieved is like a happy or relaxed feeling that you get if you avoid something bad.", "start": 171.9, "end": 179.86}, {"text": "Right?", "start": 180.0, "end": 180.14}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 180.28, "end": 180.48}, {"text": "I'm so relieved that didn't happen.", "start": 180.62, "end": 182.6}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 182.84, "end": 183.0}, {"text": "Now for our second word.", "start": 183.0, "end": 184.94}, {"text": "Pick me up.", "start": 185.12, "end": 185.96}, {"text": "Pick me up.", "start": 186.16, "end": 187.28}, {"text": "Pick me up.", "start": 187.52, "end": 188.92}, {"text": "So when you ask someone to pick you up, you're saying basically...", "start": 189.16, "end": 192.88}, {"text": "Come and get me.", "start": 192.88, "end": 193.42}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 193.6, "end": 193.82}, {"text": "So let's give a couple of examples.", "start": 193.9, "end": 195.64}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 196.06, "end": 196.32}, {"text": "My husband was supposed to pick me up from work yesterday, but he forgot.", "start": 196.32, "end": 201.38}, {"text": "Does that really happen?", "start": 202.36, "end": 203.48}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 203.74, "end": 204.08}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 205.3, "end": 205.9}, {"text": "We'll have a talk with him.", "start": 205.9, "end": 206.98}, {"text": "Or we could also say, oh, I need to hurry up.", "start": 207.02, "end": 209.6}, {"text": "The taxi will pick me up at seven.", "start": 209.72, "end": 211.32}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 211.6, "end": 211.9}, {"text": "So come and get me.", "start": 211.9, "end": 213.9}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 214.08, "end": 214.2}, {"text": "Pick me up.", "start": 214.46, "end": 215.04}, {"text": "And our final word in today's language takeaway is...", "start": 215.4, "end": 218.68}, {"text": "Ordinary.", "start": 219.26, "end": 220.1}, {"text": "Ordinary.", "start": 220.92, "end": 221.64}, {"text": "Ordinary.", "start": 222.08, "end": 222.78}, {"text": "Ordinary.", "start": 223.02, "end": 223.42}, {"text": "So ordinary is a normal word.", "start": 224.16, "end": 227.14}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 227.42, "end": 227.8}, {"text": "Meaning?", "start": 227.82, "end": 228.48}, {"text": "It's normal.", "start": 228.86, "end": 229.6}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 229.78, "end": 229.98}, {"text": "Nothing uncommon about it.", "start": 229.98, "end": 231.34}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 231.5, "end": 231.64}, {"text": "So you can have like an ordinary person.", "start": 231.98, "end": 233.84}, {"text": "An ordinary day.", "start": 234.02, "end": 235.14}, {"text": "An ordinary day.", "start": 235.3, "end": 236.16}, {"text": "Ordinary life.", "start": 236.74, "end": 237.72}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 237.92, "end": 238.18}, {"text": "Nothing exciting about it.", "start": 238.46, "end": 239.82}, {"text": "What else is ordinary?", "start": 240.56, "end": 241.74}, {"text": "Ordinary podcast.", "start": 242.02, "end": 242.8}, {"text": "An ordinary podcast, which EnglishPod is not.", "start": 243.06, "end": 245.46}, {"text": "Is not.", "start": 245.54, "end": 245.64}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 245.88, "end": 246.18}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 246.36, "end": 246.64}, {"text": "So ordinary.", "start": 246.96, "end": 247.74}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 248.18, "end": 248.54}, {"text": "Great words.", "start": 248.76, "end": 249.36}, {"text": "And I guess now we can listen to our dialogue a second time.", "start": 249.36, "end": 252.38}, {"text": "This time it'll be a little bit slower.", "start": 252.52, "end": 254.22}, {"text": "And this will help you to understand the language more clearly.", "start": 254.22, "end": 257.54}, {"text": "I'm so relieved that your ankle wasn't broken.", "start": 265.14, "end": 267.6}, {"text": "I feel just awful about this whole thing.", "start": 268.02, "end": 270.84}, {"text": "I want to make it up to you.", "start": 271.34, "end": 272.88}, {"text": "Let me take you out to dinner tonight.", "start": 273.24, "end": 275.42}, {"text": "My treat.", "start": 275.66, "end": 276.46}, {"text": "That sounds great.", "start": 277.12, "end": 278.68}, {"text": "I'd love to.", "start": 279.04, "end": 280.1}, {"text": "Here is my address.", "start": 280.66, "end": 281.98}, {"text": "Pick me up at 8?", "start": 282.48, "end": 284.1}, {"text": "Perfect.", "start": 284.98, "end": 285.54}, {"text": "Thank you for such a lovely evening.", "start": 286.3, "end": 288.68}, {"text": "The food was amazing.", "start": 288.68, "end": 290.34}, {"text": "And I had a great time.", "start": 290.6, "end": 292.64}, {"text": "Me too.", "start": 293.04, "end": 293.82}, {"text": "You look so beautiful tonight.", "start": 294.2, "end": 297.2}, {"text": "I wish this night would never end.", "start": 297.62, "end": 299.66}, {"text": "There's something I have to tell you.", "start": 300.12, "end": 302.26}, {"text": "What is it?", "start": 302.96, "end": 304.22}, {"text": "I woke up today thinking this would be just like any other ordinary day.", "start": 304.74, "end": 310.36}, {"text": "But I was wrong.", "start": 310.64, "end": 311.82}, {"text": "A twist of fate brought us together.", "start": 311.82, "end": 314.8}, {"text": "I crashed into your life.", "start": 315.55999999999995, "end": 317.72}, {"text": "And you into mine.", "start": 317.9, "end": 319.26}, {"text": "And this may sound crazy.", "start": 319.72, "end": 321.7}, {"text": "But I'm falling in love with you, Veronica.", "start": 321.86, "end": 324.92}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 330.74, "end": 331.34}, {"text": "So we looked at some great vocabulary.", "start": 331.34, "end": 333.06}, {"text": "And now we can look at some great phrases.", "start": 333.06, "end": 335.26}, {"text": "So let's start with Fluency Builder.", "start": 335.26, "end": 337.4}, {"text": "Fluency Builder.", "start": 339.04, "end": 339.92}, {"text": "On Fluency Builder today we have three great phrases.", "start": 340.56, "end": 343.72}, {"text": "So why don't we just start with the first one.", "start": 344.02, "end": 345.98}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 346.24, "end": 346.62}, {"text": "The first one we heard at the beginning of the dialogue.", "start": 346.66, "end": 348.6}, {"text": "Make it up to you.", "start": 348.94, "end": 350.92}, {"text": "Make it up to you.", "start": 351.1, "end": 352.36}, {"text": "Make it up to you.", "start": 352.44, "end": 353.56}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 353.8, "end": 354.24}, {"text": "So we have some great examples on how we use make it up.", "start": 354.3, "end": 356.82}, {"text": "So let's listen.", "start": 356.94, "end": 357.72}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 359.84, "end": 360.64}, {"text": "I'm sorry I forgot your birthday.", "start": 363.82000000000005, "end": 365.62}, {"text": "How can I make it up to you?", "start": 366.04, "end": 367.34}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 371.82000000000005, "end": 372.52}, {"text": "I feel terrible for calling your mother fat.", "start": 376.88, "end": 378.92}, {"text": "I want to make it up to her.", "start": 379.64, "end": 380.98}, {"text": "So I got her these flowers.", "start": 381.2, "end": 382.22}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 387.72, "end": 388.52}, {"text": "John forgot my anniversary again.", "start": 393.28, "end": 395.1}, {"text": "He's going to have to make it up to me.", "start": 395.62, "end": 397.06}, {"text": "We can see from the examples that when you use the phrase make it up to you,", "start": 400.58, "end": 405.3}, {"text": "you're kind of saying you want to balance something bad you did with some good action, right?", "start": 405.48, "end": 411.4}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 411.86, "end": 412.26}, {"text": "So if you call your mother-in-law fat.", "start": 412.38, "end": 414.96}, {"text": "You better buy her at least some flowers or a card or something.", "start": 415.18, "end": 419.04}, {"text": "To make it up, right?", "start": 419.28, "end": 420.14}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 420.14, "end": 420.44}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 420.64, "end": 420.92}, {"text": "So the bad action was?", "start": 421.24, "end": 422.8}, {"text": "Calling her fat.", "start": 423.02, "end": 423.94}, {"text": "And the balancing good action was the flowers.", "start": 424.12, "end": 426.72}, {"text": "The flowers.", "start": 427.14, "end": 427.22}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 427.28, "end": 427.48}, {"text": "I don't think flowers will be enough though.", "start": 427.74, "end": 429.44}, {"text": "Looks like a doomed marriage.", "start": 429.74, "end": 431.3}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 432.38, "end": 432.9}, {"text": "Our second phrase, my treat.", "start": 432.9, "end": 435.4}, {"text": "My treat.", "start": 435.64, "end": 436.7}, {"text": "My treat.", "start": 437.02, "end": 437.58}, {"text": "So we use this phrase when we want to say, I'll invite you.", "start": 437.6, "end": 441.16}, {"text": "I'll pay for you.", "start": 441.26, "end": 442.1}, {"text": "I'll pay.", "start": 442.2, "end": 442.62}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 442.78, "end": 443.06}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 443.38, "end": 443.64}, {"text": "So I can say, hey, let's go get some beers.", "start": 443.74, "end": 447.3}, {"text": "It's my treat.", "start": 447.56, "end": 448.38}, {"text": "Oh, thanks, Marco.", "start": 448.38, "end": 449.24}, {"text": "So I'm paying, right?", "start": 450.06, "end": 451.5}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 451.64, "end": 451.86}, {"text": "My treat.", "start": 452.3, "end": 452.88}, {"text": "And our last phrase for Fluency Builder, a twist of fate.", "start": 453.34, "end": 457.98}, {"text": "A twist of fate.", "start": 458.22, "end": 460.02}, {"text": "Twist of fate.", "start": 460.32, "end": 461.34}, {"text": "A twist of fate.", "start": 461.5, "end": 462.26}, {"text": "So Erica, what is a twist of fate?", "start": 462.26, "end": 464.58}, {"text": "A twist of fate is an unplanned event that has a big impact on your future or your life.", "start": 464.74, "end": 471.98}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 472.24, "end": 472.52}, {"text": "Marco, can you give us an example of a twist of fate?", "start": 472.94, "end": 475.58}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 476.36, "end": 477.06}, {"text": "For example.", "start": 477.24, "end": 477.94}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 478.22, "end": 478.38}, {"text": "You're supposed to catch a flight to another country.", "start": 478.44, "end": 481.38}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 481.54, "end": 482.08}, {"text": "But you're late.", "start": 482.3, "end": 483.46}, {"text": "So you miss your flight.", "start": 483.46, "end": 484.86}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 485.06, "end": 485.4}, {"text": "And that flight crashes.", "start": 485.4, "end": 488.88}, {"text": "Wow.", "start": 489.2, "end": 489.46}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 489.72, "end": 489.92}, {"text": "So that's a twist of fate.", "start": 490.2, "end": 491.56}, {"text": "So yeah, it's like fate.", "start": 492.46000000000004, "end": 494.7}, {"text": "It's like destiny.", "start": 494.7, "end": 495.78}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 496.24, "end": 496.56}, {"text": "You weren't supposed to be on that flight.", "start": 498.18000000000006, "end": 500.34}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 500.62, "end": 500.9}, {"text": "So a twist of fate.", "start": 500.9, "end": 502.04}, {"text": "A twist of fate.", "start": 502.3, "end": 502.78}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 503.06, "end": 503.3}, {"text": "On a happier note, let's listen to the dialogue a third time.", "start": 503.3, "end": 508.08}, {"text": "I'm so relieved that your ankle wasn't broken.", "start": 518.9000000000001, "end": 521.0}, {"text": "I feel just awful about this whole thing.", "start": 521.02, "end": 523.28}, {"text": "I want to make it up to you.", "start": 523.54, "end": 524.8}, {"text": "Let me take you out to dinner tonight.", "start": 525.04, "end": 526.32}, {"text": "My treat.", "start": 526.42, "end": 526.78}, {"text": "Oh, that sounds great.", "start": 527.16, "end": 528.46}, {"text": "I'd love to.", "start": 528.58, "end": 529.46}, {"text": "Here's my address.", "start": 530.1400000000001, "end": 531.16}, {"text": "Pick me up at eight.", "start": 531.46, "end": 532.28}, {"text": "Perfect.", "start": 532.76, "end": 533.2}, {"text": "Thank you for such a lovely evening.", "start": 546.56, "end": 548.5}, {"text": "The food was amazing and I had a great time.", "start": 548.66, "end": 551.22}, {"text": "Me too.", "start": 551.44, "end": 551.88}, {"text": "You look so beautiful tonight.", "start": 552.22, "end": 554.42}, {"text": "I wish this night would never end.", "start": 554.74, "end": 556.24}, {"text": "There's something that I have to tell you.", "start": 556.9000000000001, "end": 558.26}, {"text": "But what is it?", "start": 558.52, "end": 559.5}, {"text": "I woke up today thinking that this would be just like", "start": 559.68, "end": 563.04}, {"text": "any other day.", "start": 563.04, "end": 563.68}, {"text": "But I was wrong.", "start": 564.34, "end": 565.26}, {"text": "The twist of fate brought us together.", "start": 566.02, "end": 567.66}, {"text": "I crashed into your life and you into mine.", "start": 567.88, "end": 570.04}, {"text": "And this may sound crazy, but I'm falling in love with you, Veronica.", "start": 570.2, "end": 573.66}, {"text": "Okay, so we're back.", "start": 589.4000000000001, "end": 591.0}, {"text": "Okay, so we're back.", "start": 591.2, "end": 591.72}, {"text": "Erica, I know you have a story of a twist of fate in your life.", "start": 591.72, "end": 595.6}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 595.82, "end": 596.1}, {"text": "Recently, actually, this happened.", "start": 596.76, "end": 598.22}, {"text": "I went to this party.", "start": 598.22, "end": 600.16}, {"text": "And at the party, there was a contest, like sort of a lottery.", "start": 600.4, "end": 604.04}, {"text": "You could buy some tickets and win a prize.", "start": 604.52, "end": 606.94}, {"text": "And the prize was a week-long vacation.", "start": 606.94, "end": 609.12}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 609.42, "end": 609.68}, {"text": "So I went with some friends of mine and they were tired.", "start": 610.0, "end": 613.98}, {"text": "So they left early and they gave me their tickets.", "start": 613.98, "end": 616.4}, {"text": "Wow.", "start": 616.8, "end": 617.14}, {"text": "And guess what happened?", "start": 617.14, "end": 618.22}, {"text": "What happened?", "start": 618.48, "end": 619.22}, {"text": "We won.", "start": 619.4, "end": 620.14}, {"text": "We won the week-long vacation.", "start": 620.3, "end": 622.16}, {"text": "Wow.", "start": 622.54, "end": 622.66}, {"text": "Yeah, it was amazing.", "start": 622.66, "end": 623.96}, {"text": "So that was a really lucky twist of fate for me.", "start": 624.16, "end": 627.42}, {"text": "A lucky twist of fate.", "start": 627.54, "end": 627.98}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 628.1, "end": 628.3}, {"text": "That's a good story.", "start": 628.3, "end": 629.26}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 629.42, "end": 629.58}, {"text": "I'm sure it wasn't that good of a twist of fate for your friends.", "start": 629.76, "end": 633.38}, {"text": "Yeah, but they were very generous and let me have the prize anyway.", "start": 633.52, "end": 636.76}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 637.38, "end": 637.82}, {"text": "Well, we want to hear your stories of maybe some type of twist of fate that you've had.", "start": 637.98, "end": 642.56}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 642.66, "end": 642.94}, {"text": "Maybe love stories, maybe tragic stories, any story.", "start": 643.3, "end": 646.46}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 646.46, "end": 647.1}, {"text": "So be sure to leave your questions and comments and your stories at our website, EnglishPod.com,", "start": 647.48, "end": 652.68}, {"text": "and where you can also find us to answer any questions or doubts.", "start": 653.7599999999999, "end": 657.86}, {"text": "Yes, that's right.", "start": 658.06, "end": 658.72}, {"text": "So I guess until then, it's...", "start": 659.14, "end": 661.38}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 661.38, "end": 661.64}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 661.84, "end": 661.96}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 662.48, "end": 662.7}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 662.7, "end": 662.76}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 663.76, "end": 664.04}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 664.22, "end": 664.58}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 664.88, "end": 664.94}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 665.06, "end": 665.22}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 665.36, "end": 665.48}, 